  "notes": [
    "The supplied cake artwork is used unchanged; no extra HTML candle bodies or flame overlays are rendered.",
    "The memory thumbnails and modal photographs use object-fit:contain to preserve the full photo.",
    "The open diary image is displayed at its native 1408:768 aspect ratio; six independent photos are placed with separate transforms.",
    "At widths up to 900px, the complete open-book image stays at a readable native-ratio canvas and the diary viewport scrolls horizontally rather than shrinking the six photos.",
    "The sharp desktop wallpaper layer keeps the image ratio; only a blurred duplicate uses cover sizing to fill wide-screen margins.",
    "The supplied checkerboard-patterned JPG pixels are intentionally retained exactly as provided."
  ]
